&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 20px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐ明朝&amp;apos;"&gt;株当たりの&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 20px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐ明朝&amp;apos;"&gt;払込金額&lt;/span&gt;
